{
  "id": 8834808512711,
  "title": "Norse Mythology Viking Shield with Crossed Axes Quilt",
  "handle": "norse-mythology-viking-shield-with-crossed-axes-quilt-ca630a284e-ca630a284e",
  "body_html": "<p>Elevate your bedroom decor with this unique Viking themed quilt from Jeminise. Featuring a highly detailed graphic illustration of Norse mythology, this quilt is perfect for adding a touch of bold style and comfort to any guest room or master bedroom. Crafted for both year-round warmth and breathability, it makes a thoughtful personalized gift for holidays, anniversaries, or birthdays.</p>\n\n<h3>Key Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Customize your item by selecting your preferred size, adding optional matching pillowcases, or adding a custom name.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Viking Art Theme:</strong> Features detailed Norse mythology graphics including a Viking shield, crossed axes, Mjolnir, runes, and a ribbon banner.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Comforting Material:</strong> Constructed with a soft, breathable polyester outer layer and filled with high-quality silk floss.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Choose from Throw (60x70 in), Twin (68x86 in), Full (80x90 in), Queen (90x90 in), and King (102x91 in).</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water; dries quickly and fluffs up beautifully after air drying.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Use:</strong> Perfect for indoor bed use, lounging on the sofa, outdoor camping, or picnics.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3>Product Specifications</h3>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Quilt Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fill Material</th>\n<td>Silk Floss</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Tree of Life, Viking</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Viking Decor</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Viking Pattern</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All Season</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
